---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const title = "Terms of Use - FERS Retirement Calculator";
const description =
  "Terms for using the free FERS Retirement Calculator: educational estimates only, no official OPM determination, no warranties, and acceptable use.";
const updated = "2026-09-10";

const schema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebPage",
  name: title,
  description: description,
  url: "https://www.fers-retirement-calculator.com/terms/",
  inLanguage: "en",
  dateModified: updated,
};
---

<Layout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  canonical="https://www.fers-retirement-calculator.com/terms/"
  schema={schema}
  updatedTime={updated}
>
  <section class="hero-sheen border-b border-line bg-surface">
    <div class="page-shell py-14 sm:py-16">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent">Terms</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-balance text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-5xl">
        Terms of Use
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
        Last updated: {updated}
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-pad">
    <div class="page-shell max-w-3xl">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-3xl">Educational purpose only</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">
        FERS Retirement Calculator is a free educational tool. The estimates it produces are approximations based on published
        FERS rules and the inputs you provide. They are not an official OPM annuity computation, not benefits counseling, and not
        legal, tax, or financial advice. Only your agency HR office, your servicing retirement counselor, and OPM can determine
        your actual benefits.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-3xl">No warranties</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">
        The site and its estimates are provided "as is" without warranties of any kind, express or implied. While formulas are
        checked against OPM's FERS Computation guidance, rules change and individual circumstances vary — special provisions,
        deposits owed, partial-year service, and pay history can all change the real numbers. Verify everything important with
        official sources before acting.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-3xl">Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">
        To the maximum extent permitted by law, the site's operators are not liable for any loss or decision made in reliance on
        the estimates or content provided. Retirement decisions have lasting consequences; use this tool to prepare questions for
        your HR office, not as the final word.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-3xl">Acceptable use</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">
        You may use and share the calculator freely, including embedding it via the provided embed page with attribution. You may
        not misrepresent the tool as an official government service, scrape the site in a way that degrades service for others, or
        use it in any manner that violates applicable law.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-3xl">Intellectual property</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">
        The site's design, text, and code are the property of its operators. FERS rules, formulas, and official guidance referenced
        here are US government works; the calculator implements publicly available rules and claims no rights over them.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-3xl">Changes to these terms</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">
        These terms may be updated from time to time; the last updated date above reflects the current version. Continued use of
        the site after changes constitutes acceptance. Questions can be sent to
        <a href="mailto:hello@fers-retirement-calculator.com" class="font-semibold text-primary hover:underline">hello@fers-retirement-calculator.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
